{"2407780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gus Game", "steam_appid": 2407780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the thrilling universe of Gus Game, a multiplayer game designed for groups of up to 15 players. Immerse yourself in a variety of 60 distinct mini-games, each offering unique and entertaining challenges. Whether you want to show your skills, challenge your strategy, or just have fun with friends, <strong>Gus Game</strong> is a great multiplayer experience to enjoy together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407780/extras/d195683da2fffa2c48159dec66668132.poster.avif?t=1785957173\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407780/extras/d195683da2fffa2c48159dec66668132.webm?t=1785957173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407780/extras/d195683da2fffa2c48159dec66668132.mp4?t=1785957173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your friends who deserves the crown in the end! (making them bite the dust)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407780/extras/e5bca2253e0878be296a649f2d0b4890.poster.avif?t=1785957173\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407780/extras/e5bca2253e0878be296a649f2d0b4890.webm?t=1785957173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407780/extras/e5bca2253e0878be296a649f2d0b4890.mp4?t=1